  WrittenDialogue: "I think all those eating contests really caught up to me.\nI’m fat and hideous, guys never text me now.\nUnless they’re black, then a lot of them text me actually.\nThere’s a burning desire to change my life but...\nI have a bigger desire to eat the shame away!\nOh, my delivery’s here.\nThe usual 50 chicken kickers and a medium pizza.\nThe medium pizza’s an appetizer. That’s what I tell myself.\nAw it smells so good, it smells like friendship. I gotta dig in!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
